intro: The Sydney Seals Freediving Club runs entirely on volunteers. The committee handles overall management of the club and is elected each year. Coaches, safety representatives, and photographers donate their time to keep training safe, fun, and well documented. You do not have to be on the committee to run an event&#8212;any member can submit a proposal or pitch in.
